{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_08",
  "title": "最后的怯薛",
  "storyCode": "NL-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "70705dc181aabeb6f02e709046d36af37c681f32c4ed12eb5f4759e42731ff20",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 8-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G10"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突然出现的冠军，以雷霆之势阻止一触即发的二人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨晚的比赛由于逐魇骑士的法术涉嫌违规而遭到终止，而阻止了事态进一步恶化的人，正是“英雄”血骑士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而逐魇骑士与耀骑士也以平手告终，逐魇骑士接下来将直接与因对手投降而轮空的血骑士交战——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平手......？逐魇犯规，难道不该让耀骑士晋级吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们不希望感染者顺利晋级，当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑟奇亚克人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他刚和家人见面，给他一点时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......说真的，我对他本来没什么好感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都看得出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实，原来你没打算表现得那么露骨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他也是个有血有肉的人，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这座城市经常让我们忘了这点......我们都是活着的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们应该有自己的选择，有自己的生活，而不是......在无尽的浪潮中，迷失自我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血骑士与逐魇骑士的旷世之战，将在明晚打响！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播里的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请各位观众，锁定骑士之夜频道，明晚八点，为您带来绝佳的观战体验！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“正义骑士号”",
      "speakerId": "avg_4000_jnight_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（响亮的滴滴声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......正义号！你没事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾沃娜！你还不能随便下床......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，扶着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿......谢啦，小灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小灰是我独享的绰号吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，借来一用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要付版权费的喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......艾沃娜，那天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，我看到了血骑士的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......现场有鲜血法术的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是种......很糟糕的法术。现在，单纯的施法都会让我感到疼痛，难以想象操纵那种法术，血骑士要遭受多大的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......血骑士......他很强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有血骑士，才有了感染者骑士的参赛机制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......成为联合会的玩物......失去尊严和自由......但是，我们活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活着才有机会奔跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......耀骑士和血骑士，你们更支持哪一方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......血骑士。毫无疑问，他才是真正为感染者开辟了未来的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们需要的是不懈的斗争，而不是安于现状......我选择耀骑士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我选索娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还能这样啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204na_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......董事会已经决定......对零号地块实施清理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现阶段的感染者策略是错误的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204na_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "错误呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，罗德岛的领导人对零号地块的调查有些深入了。这也是无胄盟的失误。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204na_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "几位常务董事强烈要求无胄盟斩草除根。不能让罗德岛的医疗小队安然离开卡西米尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204na_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白了。但是，不是董事会全体的命令，而是“几位常务董事”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这你不需要过问。你的指挥权在我们手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204na_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准确来说，是在那边那位马克维茨先生的手里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马克维茨......你知道该怎么办。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_courtyard"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你受伤了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，是在格挡的时候受伤的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当时没什么感觉......也许伤到骨头了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别动，我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你该去请一个医生，这会影响你之后的发挥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，用冰敷一下吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法术不能治疗吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以缓解疼痛和促进创口愈合，但如果是骨折的话，处理不好会留下后遗症的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么办......下一场比赛的对手是风骑士......也是一名强敌，要是带着伤的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......佐菲娅，别这么担心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你让人怎么能不担心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一些轻伤，我已经习以为常了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这样的......还算轻伤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐......你这么努力，变得这么强，是为了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了夺得冠军吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“在规则之中战胜不了规则的主人”，叔叔是这么说的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那只是玛恩纳他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔说的是对的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我们要战胜的，并非制定规则的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们要打破的是规则本身。我们要教那些被驯化的站起身来，让那些堕落的重回光明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔他......只是不相信，不相信还有人会跟随着灯塔的指引，向风暴发起冲击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不这么想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若是能驱散这苦暗，人们总是会前进的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sportsbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这几天，你得听医生的话，静养。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下一场比赛是对付风骑士吧？如果你不能在那之前恢复过来，后果很严重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别像我一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明知手臂不行了还要勉强自己，最后只能沦落到这个下场了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，不劳各位费心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......姐姐！你看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新的臂铠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这真是......惊人的速度，我以为至少要到明天才能调整好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果只有我的话，那估计得花上个两三天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前没有根据你的新武器调整护臂的结构，再说之前也不知道怎么调整啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过有了这一次教训，玛莉娅的动作很快呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......玛莉娅，我认识一些优秀的工匠。也许我该把他们介绍给你认识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的吗！？他们是哪里的工匠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌萨斯、莱塔尼亚、东国、拉特兰，都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哇......那不是有一整支高规格的工匠团......嗯？不过制药企业真的需要一支工匠团吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就等你有机会去亲眼确认了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我突然记起来，有一年你的生日，玛恩纳叔叔给你买了一台小型无人机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结果你当天下午就把它拆掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我后来不是又拼起来了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时候她就令我惊为天人了，虽然拼好以后其实就不能飞了，但一个孩子竟然有着这么强的天赋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不过那会我总觉得玛莉娅也会成为骑士来着。不然我早该把工坊托付给玛莉娅啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁早吧，科瓦尔，我怕你不知道哪天就归西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？你在咒我早死吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你想做自己感兴趣的事情吗？玛莉娅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我还不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，玛莉娅还年轻得很呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......像这样聊天，真是很久没有过了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我把给姐姐的凝胶修复液落在工坊了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新的臂铠还需要调试......很快就是比赛了吧？我这就去拿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（姐姐......明明是挺重的伤......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（只是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？什么声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "梦魇拖着长兵，在地上划出呲呲火星。\n他的怒火令他沉吟，他循着光的味道，来到此地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——咿呀！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，不是她......你是......对了，你是她的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！你想找姐姐，做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的决斗还没有结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是比赛已经结束了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比赛......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我漫长的天途可不是为了一场比赛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耀骑士将是我这条道路上不可或缺的存在......这神圣的决斗......竟被外人打断！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你就赢下和血骑士的比赛，下一轮不就可以和姐姐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "够了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比赛......骑士比赛......花里胡哨的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "规则，观众，听听他们的欢呼！你难道没有感受到那可笑的亵渎吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这就是骑士竞技？你赢得了什么？你又得到了什么？\n荣誉、财富、家族的复苏，但少了什么......对，少了什么。\n没有过多思考的时间，就仿佛响应这片欢呼似的，玛莉娅还是高高举起了剑。\n只有手臂上传来鲜明的疼痛，足以盖过掌声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "岂可把我与那些供人把玩的弄臣相提并论！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我是怯薛的后裔，我必须完成天途。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让开，我对软弱的孩子没有兴趣，我要找的是那个耀骑士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不会让你过去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只不过是耀骑士的一个扈从。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......扈、扈从？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的美梦是别人给的，你的信念是从别处借的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当然能以年轻为借口，来替你的迷茫开脱......但这又有什么意义？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "世人可以笑耀骑士迂腐执拗，但谁能否定她行为的强大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你，你连骑士都不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......让开，否则我的刀刃将割破你的喉咙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不能，让你见到姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在逃避？不，能绽放出那般光彩的耀骑士不会是这种人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，她受伤了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道你要说，我在决斗中打伤了她，所以要等她痊愈之后，再发起挑战？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厚颜无耻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（好重——比泰特斯的枪还重！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈啊......哈啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你，已遭恐惧浸染......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你根本做不到在我的面前镇定自如地挥舞武器，若是在战场上，你已是一具尸体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这和......骑士与否无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想，保护，姐姐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耀骑士轮不到你保护，不知天高地厚的天马......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这种箭矢，与那青色的弓手相去甚远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "离那个孩子远点，梦魇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......巴特巴雅尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也要......阻拦我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛莉娅！快，站起来，到我这边来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你疯了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这不是你第一次问我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为，至少你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你无处可归了，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我，你的可汗在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怯薛的长旗在哪里？大军的王帐又在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "历史已经过去上千年了......你活在一个怎样的过去？为什么要追寻那样的传统？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些东西能给你带来什么？孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_iceforest_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拓拉。\n你的名字，意味着“草原”。\n你要，以你的血统为豪。\n在任何时候，任何地方，你都该为自己而骄傲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拓拉。\n你要作为一个普通的库兰塔活着，这是很简单的。\n读书，长大，学会一些手艺活，娶一个漂亮的老婆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴特巴雅尔。从我的母亲死在野兽的獠牙下时，我就已经下定了决心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是我自己的梦魇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在说什么胡话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我挣扎了很多年，在这个......骑士之国。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但最后，我还是被指引向了这条道路，为了实现我最后的理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......慢着，慢着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道，你这趟旅程是为了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不用多说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很衰老了，但是，你毕竟久经沙场。如果你执意阻拦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我将踏过你，将亲自打倒我为数不多的血亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧。我将向前冲锋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弗格瓦尔德师傅——躲开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛莉娅，没事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没、没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能让这个疯子去找姐姐......否则......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拦住我，是指杀死我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生活在卡西米尔的骑士，真的还懂得厮杀为何物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你们做不到。巴特巴雅尔，你老了，而这匹不谙世事的天马，你对大地的残酷一无所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们阻拦我与她的决斗，即是在玷污我们双方的名誉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "名誉之类的东西......根本不重要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那你的姐姐是在为什么而战！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你胆敢大放厥词！难道耀骑士执意在特锦赛夺冠，不正是为了重拾荣光吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "逐魇骑士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_225",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亵渎者，提起武器！你会付出代价！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我还是......不会让你过去的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "绝不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_204na_platnm",
      "aliases": [
        "白金"
      ]
    }
  ]
